meta {
  name: deleteManufacturer
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

post {
  url: https://{{customer}}.{{domain}}/jsonrpc
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "deleteManufacturer",
    "params": {
      "manufacturer_id": 10
    },
    "id": 1
  }
}

docs {
  Delete a manufacturer, optionally reassigning its products to another manufacturer

  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |---|---|---|---|
  | `manufacturer_id` | integer (nullable) | no | Internal ID of the manufacturer to delete |
  | `external_manufacturer_id` | string (nullable) | no | Your system's reference ID of the manufacturer to delete |
  | `reassign_manufacturer_id` | integer (nullable) | no | ID of the manufacturer to reassign its products to before deletion |

  **Example: Delete a manufacturer**

  ```json
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "deleteManufacturer",
    "params": {
      "manufacturer_id": 10
    },
    "id": 1
  }
  ```

  Result:

  ```json
  {
    "manufacturer_id": 10
  }
  ```
}
